\ Close a quotation. Its body lives inline in the code stream and may end
\ with arbitrary-length data (e.g. a string literal), so align to 4 bytes
\ before patching the branch and emitting the continuation: AArch64
\ instructions, and thus branch targets and displacements, are 4-byte units.
